{#- Guidance Layer -#}
Please extract only this chapter's canon_delta. Do not output creative_report, chapter_exit_state, or delta arrays.

## Factual Source Boundary (P0)
- Write canon_delta only from the final body text / `chapter_text` corresponding to FinalArtifact.
- summary_exit, shared evidence anchors, and confirmed fragments are used only for consistency alignment, not as new factual sources.
- Events, world rules, foreshadowing updates, or character changes without final body text evidence must NOT be written to canon.

